        "x² - 4x + 4 = 3 => x² - 4x + 1 = 0.",
        "Divide x³ - 2x² - 7x + 5 by x² - 4x + 1.",
        "x(x² - 4x + 1) = x³ - 4x² + x.",
        "Remainder: (2x² - 8x + 5).",
